<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Novo Login Detectado - Torex Journal</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 30px 16px; background-color: #F8FAFC; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: #1E293B;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); overflow: hidden;">

        {{> header}}

        <div style="padding: 36px 32px;">
            <div style="display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; background-color: #FFF1F2; border: 1px solid #FECDD3; border-radius: 9999px; color: #9F1239; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                ALERTA DE SEGURANÇA ⚠️
            </div>

            <h2 style="color: #0F172A; margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.4px;">
                Olá, {{name}} 👋
            </h2>

            <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
                Detectamos um novo login na sua conta <strong style="color: #0F172A;">Torex Journal</strong>:
            </p>

            <div style="background-color: #FFF1F2; border: 1px solid #FECDD3; border-left: 4px solid #E11D48; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="color: #0F172A;">🕒 Data:</strong> {{time}}</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="color: #0F172A;">💻 Dispositivo:</strong> {{device}}</p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="color: #0F172A;">🌐 Endereço IP:</strong> <span style="color: #047857; font-family: monospace; font-weight: 700;">{{ip}}</span></p>
            </div>

            <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Se foi você quem realizou o acesso, nenhuma ação adicional é necessária.</p>
            <p style="color: #BE123C; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">Não reconhece esta atividade? Recomendamos alterar sua senha imediatamente.</p>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0 16px 0;">
                <a href="#" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #E11D48; color: #FFFFFF !important; padding: 14px 34px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.25);">
                    Proteger Minha Conta
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{> footer}}

    </div>
</body>
</html>